# Dataset Information
# This dataset contains 767 monthly time series that represent the patient counts related to medical products from January 2000 to December 2006.
# It was extracted from R expsmooth package.
#
# For more details, please refer to
# Hyndman, R. J., 2015. expsmooth: Data Sets from Forecasting with Exponential Smoothing. R package version 2.3. https://CRAN.R-project.org/package=expsmooth
#
@relation Hospital
@attribute series_name string
@attribute start_timestamp date
@frequency monthly
@missing false
@equallength true
